# HOI4 modding rules

- Read `skills/hoi4-modding/SKILL.md` first; follow its Working agreement
  (first-use discovery, review ≠ modify, finding labels) and routing table.
- After any script change, run the verification loop:
  `python tools/validate.py <mod_dir>` (repo root) — fix new findings
  before claiming success.
- Every claim about game behavior must be traceable to
  `docs/claims-register.md`; label anything unverified.
